  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add olive oil to the preheated wok and swirl it around to coat the bottom.",
    "Add chopped onion to the wok and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic to the wok and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add dasima kombu sheets to the wok and cook for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "Add cod fillets to the wok and cook for 4 minutes on each side.",
    "Sprinkle portuguese spice blend, salt, and black pepper over the cod fillets.",
    "Squeeze lemon juice over the cod fillets.",
    "Transfer the wok to the oven and bake at 400 degrees for 10 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
  ],
